WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.479
On your phone, open Quick update.

2
00:00:02.479 --> 00:00:07.515
Press Mark a clearance item sold.

3
00:00:07.515 --> 00:00:12.489
Pick the item that sold.

4
00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:16.563
Turn Sold on.

5
00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:19.492
Press the button at the bottom.

6
00:00:19.492 --> 00:00:23.616
The Buy button is gone in 2 to 3 minutes.
